	<key>readme</key>
	<string>A quick camera check before a meeting. Type cam for Show/Hide Preview, Take Photo and Switch Camera (with more than one camera). The preview is small, muted and never records; photos save what it shows. Set hotkeys for the preview and for a photo by double-clicking the Hotkey objects. QuickTime Player shows the camera, because Alfred itself can't use it. Built with help from AI tools.</string>
